nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"mobile-logo\"><a href=\"https://kauaihumane.org/\" title=\"Kaua’i Humane Society\"></a></div> </div>\n </li>\n </ul>\n <ul class=\"mobile-header-items nav pull-right\">\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <a class=\"mobile-bar-toggle\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-bars\"></i></a> </div>\n </li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"mobile-bar animate-from-top\">\n <a class=\"mobile-bar-toggle close\" href=\"#\"></a>\n <div class=\"mobile-bar-inner\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n <ul class=\"mobile-bar-items nav flex-column mobile-bar-middle\">\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"mobile-logo\"><a href=\"https://kauaihumane.org/\" title=\"Kaua’i Humane Society\"></a></div> </div>\n </li>\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <button data-blackbaud-optimized-form-id=\"229f760c-8924-49ad-8105-05a12f6df46a\"> Donate Today </button> </div>\n </li>\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"breno-mobile-main-menu\"></div> </div>\n </li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div id=\"page\" class=\"breno-wrapper\">\n <header class=\"breno-header\">\n <div class=\"header-inner hidden-sm-down\">\n <div class=\"logobar clearfix\">\n <div class=\"custom-container logobar-inner\">\n <ul class=\"logobar-items nav pull-left\">\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"main-logo\">\n <a href=\"https://kauaihumane.org/\" title=\"Kaua’i Humane Society\"></a>\n </div> </div>\n </li>\n </ul>\n <ul class=\"logobar-items nav pull-right\">\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"header-phone\"><span class=\"fa fa-phone\"></span> 808-555-0100</div> </div>\n </li>\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"header-email\"><span class=\"fa fa-envelope-o\"></span> <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.org\">someone@example.org</a></div> </div>\n </li>\n <li class=\"nav-item\">\n <div class=\"nav-item-inner\">\n <div class=\"header-address\"><span class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></span> 3-825 Kaumualii Hwy, Lihue, HI 96766\n| Mail: PO Box 3330, Lihue, HI 96766</div> </div>\n </li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\t</header>\n\t<div class=\"breno-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"breno-content breno-page\">\n <div class=\"breno-content-inner\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-12 page-has-no-sidebar\">\n <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n <div class=\"row event\">\n <div class=\"col-sm-12 event-inner event-modal-1\">\n <div class=\"alert alert-warning event-closed\" role=\"alert\">\n <span class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></span>Event closed. </div>\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-8 col-sm-12\">\n <div class=\"event-image-wrap\">\n <div class=\"event-img\">\n </div>\n </div> \n <div class=\"event-content-wrap\">\n <div class=\"event-title\">\n </div>\n <div class=\"team-content\">\n <div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1549694235085\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1768443940475\">\n <div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n <div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"></div></div></div>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n <div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n </div>\n\t</div>\n<h3>Doggy Hour &amp; Kitten Yoga at Hale Lihue</h3>\n<p>Grab a coffee, meet adoptable dogs or do some yoga with kittens at this special Kauaʻi Humane Society event at Hale Līhuʻe, happening <strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"271\">every 2nd Tuesday of the month</strong>!</p>\n<p>📍 Location: Hale Līhuʻe, 4286 Rice Street, Līhuʻe</p>\n<p><strong>Doggy Hour at Ha Coffee</strong><br>\n10:00 AM – 12:00 PM<br>\nEnjoy a drink from Ha Coffee and spend time with adoptable dogs from KHS in the Ha Coffee area and outdoor lānai. It’s the perfect chance to socialize, cuddle pups, and learn more about adopting, fostering, or volunteering.</p>\n<p><strong>Kitten Yoga</strong><br>\n10:00 AM – 11:00 AM<br>\nJoin KHS for a donation-based Kitten Yoga class led by a certified instructor, held inside the multipurpose room. Relax, stretch, and flow while playful, adoptable kittens roam around for snuggles and fun.</p>\n<p>A suggested $25 donation is appreciated for Kitten Yoga, with 100% of proceeds supporting animals in KHS care. Donations are also encouraged throughout the event. Please bring your own yoga mat (kittens may scratch so an older mat or towel is recommended).</p>\n<p>Spots for Kitten Yoga are limited, so be sure to sign up in advance using the button below. Come for one event or enjoy both to support the animals in our care!</p>\n </div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_empty_space\"><span class=\"vc_empty_space_inner\"></span></div><div class=\"btn-wrap\"><a href=\"https://bit.ly/kitten-yoga-July-2026\" class=\"btn breno-btn btn-default \" data-css=\"&quot;&quot;\">Kitten Yoga Sign-Up for 7/14</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n <div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n <p>Upcoming Events:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"187\">\n<p data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"187\">July 14, 2026: Doggy Hour &amp; Kitten Yoga</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"207\">\n<p data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"207\">August 11, 2026: Doggy Hour</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"229\">\n<p data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"229\">September 8, 2026: Doggy Hour</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">\n<p data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"250\">October 13, 2026: Doggy Hour</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"272\">\n<p data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"272\">November 10, 2026: Doggy Hour</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"293\">\n<p data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"293\">December 8, 2026: Doggy Hour</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See you there!</p>\n </div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div> </div> \n </div>\t\n </div>\n <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n <div class=\"event-info-wrap\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n <div class=\"event-info\">\n <h4>Event Details</h4>\n <p class=\"event-organizer\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>Organizer : \n </strong>\n </span>\n Kaua`i Humane Society </p> <p class=\"event-start-date\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>Start Date : \n </strong>\n </span>\n 2026-08-11 </p> <p class=\"event-end-date\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>End Date : \n </strong>\n </span>\n 2026-08-11 </p> <p class=\"event-time\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>Time : \n </strong>\n </span>\n 10:00 am </p> <p class=\"event-cost\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>Cost : \n </strong>\n </span>\n By Donation </p> <p class=\"event-cost\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>More About Event : \n </strong>\n </span>\n <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"https://bit.ly/kitten-yoga-august-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Kitten Yoga Sign Up for August 11, 2026</a>\n </p> </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n <div class=\"event-venue\">\n <h4>Event Venue</h4>\n <p class=\"event-venue-name\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>Venue : \n </strong>\n </span>\n Hale Līhuʻe </p> <p class=\"event-address\">\n <span class=\"event-subtitle\">\n <strong>Address : \n </strong>\n </span>\n 4286 Rice Street, Lihue, HI 96766 </p> </div>\n </div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"custom-post-nav\">\n <a href=\"#\" class=\"disabled\"><i class=\"fa fa-angle-double-left\"></i></a>\n <div class=\"next-nav-link\">\n <a href=\"https://kauaihumane.org/event/2027-photo-fundraiser-calendar/\" class=\"next\"><p>Next Post</p><i class=\"flaticon-long-right-arrow\"></i></a>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\t</div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n</body></html><!-- Cached by WP-Optimize (gzip) - https://teamupdraft.com/wp-optimize/ - Last modified: September 17, 2026 4:42 pm (UTC:0) -->"
